{"resource": {"name": "Public Postsecondary Fall Enrollment by Race and Gender", "id": "v4jy-wi85", "resource_name": null, "parent_fxf": [], "description": "Total undergraduate Fall enrollment headcount and percentages by race and gender at all public Massachusetts institutions of higher education since 2014.\n\nRelated datasets:\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/College-and-Career/Public-Postsecondary-Fall-Enrollment/gzpm-dvfd/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public Postsecondary Fall Enrollment</a>\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/dataset/Public-Postsecondary-Annual-Enrollment/j7yp-crt6/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public Postsecondary Annual Enrollment</a>\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/College-and-Career/Public-Postsecondary-Annual-Enrollment-by-Race-and/hx2h-9z86/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public Postsecondary Annual Enrollment by Race and Gender</a>\n\nNotes:\n- Data appear as reported to the Massachusetts Department of Higher Education.\n- Figures published here may vary from those of individual institutions due to differences in calculation methodologies.", "attribution": "MA Department of Higher Education", "attribution_link": "https://www.mass.edu/datacenter/access/home.asp", "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-05-28T14:10:57.000Z", "createdAt": "2023-04-24T15:29:45.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-05-28T14:10:55.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2024-05-28T14:10:57.000Z", "columns_name": ["HISPLAT_PCT", "YEAR_FALL_TERM", "FEMALE_CNT", "FEMALE_PCT", "MALE_PCT", "AAPI_CNT", "MULTIRACE_PCT", "UNKNRACE_CNT", "UNKNRACE_PCT", "WHITE_CNT", "WHITE_PCT", "INSTITUTION", "MULTIRACE_CNT", "USNONRES_PCT", "USNONRES_CNT", "HISPLAT_CNT", "AFRAMER_PCT", "AFRAMER_CNT", "AAPI_PCT", "AMERIND_CNT", "UNKNGENDER_CNT", "MALE_CNT", "STUDENT_CNT", "SEGMENT", "AMERIND_PCT", "UNKNGENDER_PCT"], "columns_field_name": ["his